OL,3,GNEWSALibrary is 'bridging cultures and
OL,4,Abuilding friendships'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first anniversary of the twinning
OL,7,Fbetween two villages is set to be
OL,8,Fmarked with the opening of a new
OL,9,Flibrary and resource centre.
OL,11,FIn October 2025, Kennington in
OL,12,FOxfordshire officially twinned with
OL,13,FMusanda in western Kenya - the heart of
OL,14,FAbingdon-based charity The Nasio
OL,15,FTrust's community work.
OL,17,FIn 2024, Oxford author Sylvia Vetta
OL,18,Fjointly lead a project with the charity
OL,19,Fto deliver Cosmic Cats - an anthology
OL,20,Fof stories by Kennington and Kenyan
OL,21,Fstudents, aiming to raise funds for the
OL,22,Ffacility.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
