OL,3,GNEWSALibrary is 'bridging cultures and
OL,4,Abuilding friendships'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe author, who will cut its ribbon on
OL,7,F10 October, said the twinning committee
OL,8,Fchair, the Rev Sansom Kuponiyi, had
OL,9,Fcome up with the twinning motto
OL,10,F"bridging cultures, building
OL,11,Ffriendships".
